msgctxt "80"
msgid "Doc! How's the boss!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"We've done all we can to stabilize his condition. The next\r\n"
"week or so will be critical."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Is he gonna make it!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"It's hard to say with absolute certainty. He was shot three\r\n"
"times at point-blank range, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Luckily, the bullets all appear to have narrowly missed his\r\n"
"vital organs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "That is certainly something to be thankful for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "What're the odds he'll pull through, Doc? You gotta tell me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "At the moment, I'd say around fifty-fifty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr "Oh..."

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"But remember, he managed to call an ambulance entirely on\r\n"
"his own despite having been shot multiple times. I don't\r\n"
"think he's ready to leave you all just yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "And we'll do everything we can to make sure he doesn't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Thank you so much, Doc!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Sorry, Kashiwagi-san. I'm actually at a hospital right now.\r\n"
"Mind if I call you back later?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Kiryu. The sixth chairman's been shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "What? Daigo!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Tell me everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"It happened about an hour ago in his office. I'm not sure\r\n"
"of the specifics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"All we know for certain is that the man who shot him was\r\n"
"the splitting image of Patriarch Kazama."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Kazama-san!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "So I hear. I'll let you know if I learn anything more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Goodbye, Kiryu."
msgstr ""

